[0.0, "o", "[vibestackr] init hands off to an AI coding agent already on your machine (claude/codex/opencode/etc) \u2014 it inspects this repo (package.json, docker-compose, Dockerfiles, existing dev scripts...) and writes a .vibestackr.yaml describing your local dev stack for you.\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
